WEBVTT

01:18.660 --> 01:21.830
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.920 --> 01:24.800
[Episode 22]

01:36.120 --> 01:37.350
I'm so tired.

01:39.070 --> 01:40.940
After I told Lu Ze

01:41.729 --> 01:43.680
that I wouldn't marry him,

01:45.920 --> 01:47.759
I literally had no energy left.

01:52.530 --> 01:54.330
What on earth is going on with me?

02:02.860 --> 02:04.170
It's New Year's Eve.

02:04.270 --> 02:05.930
Why is Jingjing so miserable?

02:11.060 --> 02:13.110
Come on, let's go to my place first.

02:24.620 --> 02:25.300
Let's go.

02:35.730 --> 02:37.800
Don't think about anything later.

02:37.920 --> 02:39.140
Just go lie down in my room for a while.

02:39.140 --> 02:40.200
Get some sleep, okay?

02:40.200 --> 02:41.560
When you wake up,

02:41.579 --> 02:43.620
let me know if you want to talk.

02:44.000 --> 02:47.180
What would I even do without you?

02:53.130 --> 02:54.630
Then I'll go lie down for a bit.

02:54.630 --> 02:55.430
Go ahead.

02:55.600 --> 02:56.110
Okay.

03:19.480 --> 03:20.570
I'm back.

03:22.960 --> 03:24.040
I'm back.

03:35.230 --> 03:36.320
I knew it.

03:36.790 --> 03:39.120
He got everything sorted out for himself.

04:03.070 --> 04:03.860
You're back.

04:03.960 --> 04:05.420
Here, let me take your bag.

04:05.750 --> 04:06.350
Mom.

04:08.300 --> 04:09.420
You little brat.

04:09.920 --> 04:11.440
Didn't you move out?

04:11.520 --> 04:12.960
Why are you suddenly back?

04:12.960 --> 04:14.400
Isn't it New Year's Eve today?

04:14.400 --> 04:15.070
I thought

04:15.090 --> 04:16.600
I'd bring some stuff back for you and Dad.

04:16.600 --> 04:18.459
He bought a lot of delicious food.

04:18.720 --> 04:20.920
Seems like you still have a conscience.

04:20.990 --> 04:22.050
What do you want for dinner tonight?

04:22.050 --> 04:23.160
I'll cook you something good.

04:23.160 --> 04:24.840
Dad, don't count me in for dinner.

04:24.840 --> 04:26.830
I'll go meet Yifei and the others later.

04:26.830 --> 04:28.380
You're not even spending
New Year's Eve with us?

04:28.380 --> 04:29.180
That's right.

04:29.490 --> 04:32.090
I already made plans
with Yifei and the others.

04:32.650 --> 04:33.920
What an ungrateful son!

04:33.920 --> 04:35.280
So insincere.

04:35.980 --> 04:37.440
You made your mom angry again.

04:37.440 --> 04:37.960
Mom.

04:37.990 --> 04:39.450
-Alright, alright.
-Mom.

04:57.930 --> 04:59.580
You just reconciled with your mom,

04:59.580 --> 05:01.310
let's not stir up more trouble.

05:01.870 --> 05:04.100
Okay, go do whatever you need to do.

05:06.110 --> 05:07.910
I won't bother cooking tonight.

05:08.080 --> 05:10.140
I'll just have some instant noodles.

05:40.430 --> 05:41.820
I'm getting so old.

05:44.430 --> 05:46.310
It must be nice to be young.

05:50.590 --> 05:53.159
Look how well that girl dances.

05:58.190 --> 05:59.550
Right, she dances so well.

05:59.550 --> 06:01.280
You scared me. Seriously.

06:02.110 --> 06:03.640
Who did you say dances well?

06:05.790 --> 06:07.110
You dance well.

06:07.600 --> 06:09.600
You're the best dancer in the world.

06:12.220 --> 06:12.860
Get out.

06:19.500 --> 06:20.960
Close the door behind you.

06:21.740 --> 06:22.350
Okay.

06:29.400 --> 06:30.820
You have a nose like a hound!

06:30.820 --> 06:32.400
You woke up as soon as
you smelled the food?

06:32.400 --> 06:35.040
How am I just waking up
and it's already dark?

06:35.040 --> 06:36.930
I'm such a heavy sleeper.

06:37.080 --> 06:38.050
That's great.

06:38.080 --> 06:39.159
I envy you for that.

06:39.190 --> 06:40.080
Come and eat.

06:40.260 --> 06:42.230
You've already finished everything?

06:42.230 --> 06:43.210
I was thinking I could

06:43.210 --> 06:44.770
help you out or something.

06:46.310 --> 06:47.370
You must be hungry.

06:49.280 --> 06:51.320
I may be unlucky in love,

06:51.350 --> 06:52.040
but you totally

06:52.040 --> 06:53.670
made it up to me with this table of food.

06:53.670 --> 06:55.000
So it's not a total loss.

06:55.350 --> 06:56.020
Take a look.

06:56.040 --> 06:57.850
Are you satisfied
with the dishes I made today?

06:57.850 --> 07:00.050
Let's celebrate the New Year together.

07:01.400 --> 07:03.420
Not bad!

07:03.480 --> 07:05.630
What made you decide
to improve your quality of life?

07:05.630 --> 07:06.710
I didn't buy this.

07:06.730 --> 07:08.440
That loser tenant bought it.

07:09.910 --> 07:11.480
Why isn't he here?

07:11.670 --> 07:12.960
He won't mind

07:12.990 --> 07:14.280
if I crash here tonight, right?

07:14.280 --> 07:16.240
He's just a tenant.
If he has a problem with it,

07:16.240 --> 07:17.240
I'll kick him out.

07:18.160 --> 07:20.850
Besides, he might not even
come back tonight.

07:21.080 --> 07:22.810
I think he has a girlfriend now.

07:23.510 --> 07:24.300
Did he...

07:25.110 --> 07:27.270
get back together with his ex?

07:27.610 --> 07:29.130
Not that girlfriend.

07:29.160 --> 07:30.750
I think it's someone new.

07:31.050 --> 07:33.380
Anyway, I overheard him

07:33.409 --> 07:34.640
on the phone last night.

07:34.640 --> 07:36.140
Forget about him. Come on.

07:46.400 --> 07:47.159
Refreshing!

07:54.750 --> 07:55.900
Be honest with me.

07:56.159 --> 07:58.380
Are you secretly dating someone
behind my back?

07:58.380 --> 08:00.170
Who would I be dating?

08:00.920 --> 08:03.080
Then why do you seem prettier

08:03.120 --> 08:04.740
and more feminine lately?

08:05.430 --> 08:06.640
So what you're saying is,

08:06.640 --> 08:08.570
dating makes a person look better?

08:09.040 --> 08:10.520
Then when I was with Wang Ruohai,

08:10.520 --> 08:13.320
why did you always say
I looked like a country girl?

08:15.110 --> 08:16.480
Because you were with the wrong guy.

08:16.480 --> 08:17.830
If you're not dating anyone, then someone

08:17.830 --> 08:19.830
must've helped you with your style.

08:19.880 --> 08:20.890
And now you can even

08:20.890 --> 08:22.160
joke about Wang Ruohai.

08:22.160 --> 08:23.360
You've made progress.

08:23.360 --> 08:25.470
We broke up ages ago.

08:25.470 --> 08:26.790
I moved on from him a long time ago.

08:26.790 --> 08:27.650
Come on.

08:27.760 --> 08:29.460
Anyway, I just feel like

08:30.480 --> 08:32.559
something's changed about you,
but I can't quite describe it.

08:32.559 --> 08:34.230
Alright, just eat already.

08:34.230 --> 08:35.400
Even all this food can't keep you quiet?

08:35.400 --> 08:36.330
Hurry, try some.

08:36.440 --> 08:38.200
It can, it can.

08:38.200 --> 08:39.400
See? I'm eating.

08:41.919 --> 08:43.750
Just now, someone

08:44.039 --> 08:45.320
was so down and upset,

08:45.350 --> 08:47.350
and now she's back to full strength?

08:48.560 --> 08:51.090
Tell me, what's going on
between you and Lu Ze?

08:52.280 --> 08:54.540
Nothing. I just don't want to talk to him.

08:55.710 --> 08:57.310
You don't want to talk to him?

08:57.510 --> 08:59.080
Then why does it look like

09:00.280 --> 09:02.280
you still can't let him go?

09:03.680 --> 09:05.530
How is that possible?

09:05.560 --> 09:07.680
I'll move on later, okay?

09:10.110 --> 09:12.630
I heard that Lu Ze

09:13.680 --> 09:16.080
shut down that Xinxin Vision.

09:16.110 --> 09:17.520
You always said

09:17.820 --> 09:19.250
he chose work over you.

09:19.330 --> 09:20.400
Now that he's chosen you,

09:20.400 --> 09:21.930
you don't want him anymore.

09:34.230 --> 09:36.170
What's going on?

09:36.520 --> 09:38.580
Why are you getting emotional again?

09:38.870 --> 09:39.960
No, I'm not.

09:41.580 --> 09:43.200
What's happening?

09:45.160 --> 09:47.560
I have to record this.

09:50.590 --> 09:51.230
You...

09:51.710 --> 09:54.870
What are you doing? I'm already a mess.

09:56.630 --> 09:58.040
I'm already a mess!

09:59.230 --> 10:00.470
Look at you.

10:00.680 --> 10:02.680
Are you my sis?

10:02.680 --> 10:04.510
Are you my best friend?

10:04.510 --> 10:06.760
I'm seriously annoyed.

10:09.040 --> 10:10.320
You're annoying!

10:10.590 --> 10:11.350
Let me enjoy this for a second.

10:11.350 --> 10:13.080
Hurry up and delete that!

10:13.080 --> 10:13.630
No.

10:14.230 --> 10:15.400
Delete it!

10:15.440 --> 10:15.920
Nope.

10:21.640 --> 10:22.840
Come on, let's drink.

10:28.400 --> 10:29.590
Honey.

10:32.790 --> 10:34.390
Honey.

10:39.960 --> 10:41.040
Honey.

10:42.920 --> 10:45.370
Are you done annoying me?

10:51.850 --> 10:52.660
What's wrong?

10:53.800 --> 10:54.820
Why are you tired of me?

10:54.820 --> 10:56.420
Are you seeing someone else?

10:56.960 --> 10:58.560
You go out dancing all day.

10:58.630 --> 11:00.630
Did some creepy old guy fall for you?

11:01.120 --> 11:02.050
Don't look at me.

11:02.120 --> 11:03.080
Explain yourself.

11:03.080 --> 11:04.340
Are you cheating on me?

11:16.160 --> 11:17.080
Fine, go ahead.

11:17.510 --> 11:19.110
Let me see which old creep this is.

11:19.110 --> 11:20.840
I've gotta see this for myself!

11:38.040 --> 11:39.590
I thought you didn't like her?

11:39.590 --> 11:41.710
Why did you take so many videos of her?

11:42.230 --> 11:44.360
I think she's pretty great, actually.

11:47.110 --> 11:49.310
Well, I think this girl

11:50.820 --> 11:52.230
is actually pretty nice.

11:52.560 --> 11:53.230
Yeah.

11:55.470 --> 11:56.260
Honey,

11:56.750 --> 11:58.600
when did your attitude

11:58.630 --> 12:00.400
take a 180-degree turn?

12:01.230 --> 12:02.800
I just feel that,

12:03.510 --> 12:06.510
she doesn't have
a Shanghai household registration.

12:06.560 --> 12:08.200
Even if she were
from the outskirts, it'd be fine,

12:08.200 --> 12:10.800
but Yunnan is just way too far.

12:10.830 --> 12:12.220
Honey,

12:12.680 --> 12:16.880
as long as she is a good person,
does household registration really matter?

12:17.710 --> 12:18.400
Right?

12:18.920 --> 12:19.960
She's a nice girl.

12:24.160 --> 12:25.560
Okay, let's go to sleep.

12:36.750 --> 12:38.470
-Time to sleep!
-Go to sleep.

12:41.510 --> 12:43.450
Our boss at home finally gave in.

12:45.110 --> 12:46.990
There is hope for your relationship now.

12:46.990 --> 12:48.710
Good luck, son.

12:53.800 --> 12:55.700
What are you doing?
You respawned, hurry up.

12:55.490 --> 12:56.170
[Our boss at home finally gave in.]

12:55.800 --> 12:56.960
Coming, coming.

12:56.200 --> 12:56.950
[There is hope for your relationship now.]

12:56.970 --> 12:59.150
[Really? Thanks, Dad.
Thank Mom for me too.]

13:00.510 --> 13:01.110
Coming.

13:02.870 --> 13:05.550
Watch me go on a killing spree

13:05.680 --> 13:07.730
and destroy all of them.

13:08.800 --> 13:10.990
Why are you so excited over a video game?

13:10.990 --> 13:12.870
It's not the game I'm excited about.

13:12.870 --> 13:14.360
Isn't it because of you?

13:14.710 --> 13:17.320
Spending New Year's Eve with me,
helping me rank up,

13:17.320 --> 13:19.960
and maybe in the future, you'll even...

13:20.160 --> 13:21.690
Okay, that's enough.

13:21.920 --> 13:23.720
Hurry up and destroy the turret.

13:23.750 --> 13:24.440
Copy that.

13:37.800 --> 13:40.350
Let's sing.

13:40.470 --> 13:43.400
Let's go sing karaoke!

13:43.800 --> 13:45.680
Going karaoke so late at night,

13:45.680 --> 13:46.920
you're unbelievable.

13:46.920 --> 13:47.980
I just want to sing.

13:48.510 --> 13:49.400
I have to sing.

13:54.750 --> 13:56.400
Thank you.

14:01.630 --> 14:02.630
Give me your bag.

14:04.320 --> 14:06.400
Hello, here is our menu.

14:06.470 --> 14:06.960
Okay.

14:08.080 --> 14:10.080
Take a look, see what you want to eat.

14:10.740 --> 14:12.000
What do you want to eat?

14:13.300 --> 14:15.420
Who comes to a karaoke for the food?

14:16.080 --> 14:17.720
Let's drink. Let's keep going!

14:17.720 --> 14:21.410
♪ We believe, so it exists ♪

14:21.470 --> 14:25.160
♪ Love till death do us part ♪

14:25.400 --> 14:27.180
♪ Not pouring my heart... ♪

14:30.040 --> 14:30.920
Li Yifei!

14:31.680 --> 14:32.810
You skipped my song!

14:33.110 --> 14:35.200
You've been howling all night.
Aren't you tired?

14:35.200 --> 14:36.400
That's about enough.

14:38.960 --> 14:40.920
Are you going through menopause
or something?

14:40.920 --> 14:42.830
Don't take it out on me
just because you got stood up.

14:42.830 --> 14:43.750
Take a break.

14:43.750 --> 14:44.870
Have a drink.

14:44.870 --> 14:47.800
Yifei, did you have plans
with someone else tonight?

14:47.870 --> 14:48.470
No.

14:48.920 --> 14:49.960
Stubborn.

14:50.110 --> 14:52.160
It probably has something to do
with that landlady again.

14:52.160 --> 14:53.780
Shut up.

14:55.010 --> 14:57.300
On such an important night,

14:57.320 --> 14:58.560
getting to spend New Year's Eve with Yifei

14:58.560 --> 15:00.040
makes me genuinely happy!

15:00.750 --> 15:02.630
-Happy New Year.
-Cheers, Yifei.

15:04.790 --> 15:05.670
Jinzi,

15:06.070 --> 15:07.330
prioritizing men over friends,

15:07.330 --> 15:09.070
aren't you making it too obvious?

15:09.070 --> 15:10.460
As your important matchmaker,

15:10.460 --> 15:11.780
you've never bought me a meal

15:11.780 --> 15:12.380
or a drink.

15:13.190 --> 15:15.000
I haven't been treated to a meal either.

15:15.000 --> 15:17.840
Fine, here's to Jinzi's thriving career.

15:18.400 --> 15:19.330
What about love?

15:19.640 --> 15:20.570
Love?

15:20.850 --> 15:22.160
You two should drink with locked arms!

15:22.160 --> 15:24.670
Locked arms!

15:24.700 --> 15:27.810
Locked arms!

15:27.840 --> 15:30.590
Locked arms!

15:30.590 --> 15:31.680
-Hey, hold up.
-Locked arms!

15:31.680 --> 15:33.270
I'm a grown man,

15:33.290 --> 15:34.440
I can take a joke.

15:34.440 --> 15:36.260
But Jinzi is a lady, don't joke about her.

15:36.260 --> 15:37.920
-Right?
-But I'm fine with it.

15:42.160 --> 15:43.850
She's fine with it!

15:43.960 --> 15:44.630
Hello?

15:46.840 --> 15:47.480
Who is it?

15:47.500 --> 15:48.170
Don't leave!

15:48.170 --> 15:51.230
-It's too noisy here. I can't hear you.
-He's so boring.

15:51.230 --> 15:52.300
Come on, Qi.

15:52.320 --> 15:53.050
Let's drink.

15:53.080 --> 15:55.610
Jinzi, just ignore him. Let's drink.

15:57.460 --> 15:58.180
Cheers.

16:04.990 --> 16:07.820
I just realized that

16:08.800 --> 16:10.370
compared with you,

16:10.400 --> 16:12.960
I handled my breakup way too normal.

16:13.040 --> 16:14.500
It wasn't dramatic at all.

16:16.080 --> 16:18.360
No, that's not it.

16:18.960 --> 16:20.300
I'm telling you,

16:20.590 --> 16:24.590
your reaction wasn't normal.

16:24.920 --> 16:29.160
What I'm doing
is the standard breakup process.

16:29.480 --> 16:32.110
Got it? Standard process.

16:32.400 --> 16:33.110
Yes.

16:36.510 --> 16:38.280
Hurry, it's starting.

16:40.670 --> 16:43.550
♪ Anything's fine, it's up to you ♪

16:44.630 --> 16:47.020
This microphone is not working.

16:47.110 --> 16:48.470
This microphone!

16:49.710 --> 16:50.280
Here.

16:51.710 --> 16:52.310
Take it.

16:53.750 --> 16:54.960
♪ What you say... ♪

16:55.120 --> 16:56.030
It's working now, right?

16:56.030 --> 16:56.920
♪ Because I... ♪

16:56.990 --> 16:59.600
It's not working!

17:01.550 --> 17:04.200
♪ The heavy feeling of a blanket ♪

17:04.230 --> 17:08.790
♪ The familiar sense of security
after basking in the sun ♪

17:08.920 --> 17:10.480
♪ Sharing the hot soup ♪

17:10.500 --> 17:13.410
♪ We have two spoons and one bowl ♪

17:13.440 --> 17:17.359
♪ The left atrium is warm and full ♪

17:17.569 --> 17:20.329
♪ I want to say you're very nice ♪

17:20.359 --> 17:22.970
♪ But you don't even know it ♪

17:23.119 --> 17:25.390
♪ You are genuinely good to me ♪

17:25.470 --> 17:27.730
♪ Without asking for anything in return ♪

17:27.750 --> 17:31.550
♪ When love someone,
hope them to live a better life ♪

17:31.750 --> 17:34.350
-♪ Feel warm from the bottom of my heart ♪
-Lu Ze.

17:37.470 --> 17:39.670
Hello, Lu Ze. What's up?

17:40.270 --> 17:42.330
Sing a little longer, then head home.

17:43.920 --> 17:45.720
How did you know we were singing?

17:46.840 --> 17:48.440
You heard her voice?

17:49.400 --> 17:50.680
Don't go anywhere.

17:50.710 --> 17:52.170
I'm coming over right now.

17:53.920 --> 17:54.550
Bye-bye.

18:48.670 --> 18:49.750
Jingjing.

18:50.440 --> 18:51.990
Almost there. Only 29 more.

18:52.030 --> 18:53.360
It will be our turn soon.

18:55.450 --> 18:56.840
I'm fine.

18:57.470 --> 19:00.310
I can still drink.

19:00.440 --> 19:03.370
-Almost. Hang in there.
-Let's head to the next spot!

19:05.960 --> 19:07.550
Look, that's 28 now.

19:10.880 --> 19:12.900
We'll have a good time later.

19:17.120 --> 19:18.880
Aren't those
the two pretty girls from just now?

19:18.880 --> 19:20.480
Come on, let's go tease them.

19:20.700 --> 19:21.750
Sit up here.

19:23.710 --> 19:24.890
Hey, beauties.

19:25.270 --> 19:26.990
Waiting for us here?

19:28.000 --> 19:30.200
Why don't you join us to the next spot?

19:30.440 --> 19:31.960
We'll show you what the

19:31.990 --> 19:33.270
real nightlife's like, what do you say?

19:33.270 --> 19:34.670
We're going home. Sorry.

19:34.680 --> 19:35.750
Come on.

19:36.730 --> 19:37.890
We're going home.

19:37.920 --> 19:39.510
-Why go home now?
-We're going home.

19:39.510 --> 19:40.230
Going home is not an option.

19:40.230 --> 19:41.360
The night is still young!

19:41.360 --> 19:42.230
Let go!

19:42.270 --> 19:42.940
Listen to me.

19:42.940 --> 19:43.510
Jingjing!

19:43.510 --> 19:45.110
Come with us to the next spot.

19:45.160 --> 19:45.990
Let her go!

19:48.550 --> 19:50.410
-You're quite heavy.
-Let her go.

19:53.440 --> 19:54.770
Do you have a death wish?

19:55.360 --> 19:56.310
You brat!

19:59.440 --> 20:00.200
Are you okay?

20:03.360 --> 20:04.240
No, no, don't.

20:05.070 --> 20:05.870
Just you wait!

20:07.030 --> 20:08.510
Don't, don't get mad.

20:08.640 --> 20:09.120
Call for backup.

20:09.120 --> 20:11.030
Just wait right here. Call for backup!

20:11.030 --> 20:11.880
Just you wait!

20:12.630 --> 20:13.560
Call for backup.

20:15.470 --> 20:16.200
Are you okay?

20:20.070 --> 20:20.960
Are you okay?

20:22.550 --> 20:23.240
Hello?

20:23.600 --> 20:25.360
Yeah, downstairs.

20:25.710 --> 20:27.200
Get down here, quickly!

20:27.310 --> 20:28.030
They're calling for backup.

20:28.030 --> 20:29.300
Let's go, let's go!

20:29.330 --> 20:30.160
Stop right there!

20:30.160 --> 20:31.070
None of you are leaving!

20:31.070 --> 20:32.710
Nobody's leaving tonight.

20:32.840 --> 20:34.550
Be honest, did I look cool just now?

20:34.550 --> 20:35.230
Cool or not?

20:35.250 --> 20:37.590
You're hopeless. Let's go!

20:38.400 --> 20:39.440
How many of them can you take on?

20:39.440 --> 20:40.770
I can't even handle one.

20:42.160 --> 20:43.420
Then what should we do?

20:43.470 --> 20:44.710
-What should we do?
-What should we do?

20:44.710 --> 20:47.440
Now you're scared.
Why didn't you think of that before?

20:47.440 --> 20:48.660
You brought a girl out drinking

20:48.660 --> 20:49.360
and let her get this wasted?

20:49.360 --> 20:50.160
Penalty shot.

20:57.640 --> 21:00.500
-Do a penalty shot.
-Do you think it's appropriate?

21:01.230 --> 21:03.510
They're coming. Let's go!

21:06.360 --> 21:08.310
Let's go. Jingjing, let's go!

21:08.790 --> 21:10.660
You two aren't going anywhere.

21:11.160 --> 21:12.310
Bro.

21:12.310 --> 21:14.510
I... I don't think these are our people.

21:15.070 --> 21:15.820
Let's go.

21:23.230 --> 21:24.960
I wasn't expecting a whole army.

21:24.960 --> 21:25.680
Hey,

21:26.240 --> 21:27.310
they're all gone now.

21:27.310 --> 21:28.760
Yifei, are you okay?

21:28.790 --> 21:29.640
I'm fine.

21:30.070 --> 21:32.120
It was just a small misunderstanding.

21:32.120 --> 21:33.790
It's New Year's Eve,
let's not spoil everyone's mood.

21:33.790 --> 21:34.200
Head back.

21:34.200 --> 21:35.930
Go have fun, eat food and drink.

21:37.920 --> 21:38.710
Call me if anything happens.

21:38.710 --> 21:39.880
It's New Year's Eve, come on, go back.

21:39.880 --> 21:40.790
Go ahead, go ahead.

21:40.790 --> 21:41.680
Okay.

21:41.790 --> 21:43.720
Alright, you guys head back first.

21:46.660 --> 21:48.330
What kind of person are you?

21:48.360 --> 21:49.310
I'm a good guy.

21:52.470 --> 21:54.030
I'm seeing things.

21:54.030 --> 21:57.060
I think I just saw Lu Ze.

21:57.120 --> 21:59.230
Do I really miss him that much?

22:02.120 --> 22:03.830
What's going on here?

22:03.880 --> 22:05.070
Didn't you say you were stepping out
to make a phone call

22:05.070 --> 22:06.440
and then we'd go get late-night snacks?

22:06.440 --> 22:09.470
How did it suddenly turn into
backing you up in a fight?

22:09.960 --> 22:11.750
Did we fight? We didn't fight.

22:12.030 --> 22:13.270
Let's go. Let's get some late-night food.

22:13.270 --> 22:14.460
I'll come by later.

22:16.360 --> 22:18.640
Aren't we going
for a late-night snack right now?

22:18.640 --> 22:19.770
Go. You go ahead.

22:19.890 --> 22:21.220
-I'm hungry.
-Let's go.

22:21.990 --> 22:22.740
Let's go.

22:23.200 --> 22:25.200
-You're hungry now?
-Are you alright?

22:25.200 --> 22:26.640
I'll take you to get some porridge.

22:26.640 --> 22:28.240
You didn't get hurt, did you?

22:31.680 --> 22:32.610
Did you get hurt?

22:33.310 --> 22:34.240
Let's go.

22:34.400 --> 22:35.520
What are you doing?

22:35.710 --> 22:39.220
Don't take my Jingjing away
right in front of me.

22:39.310 --> 22:40.360
I'm watching you.

22:42.230 --> 22:43.770
I see what you're doing—

22:43.880 --> 22:46.740
you're getting revenge
for your bestie on purpose.

22:49.120 --> 22:50.350
Over here. Here.

22:52.510 --> 22:53.600
Here. Here.

22:56.240 --> 22:56.990
Slow down. Slow down.

22:56.990 --> 22:57.920
Watch your step.

23:01.070 --> 23:01.960
This way, this way.

23:01.960 --> 23:03.440
No, I'll go catch you guys later.

23:03.440 --> 23:04.910
I'll come find you guys in a bit.

23:04.910 --> 23:05.670
Wait for me.

23:07.470 --> 23:08.810
Slow down.

23:08.990 --> 23:10.030
Slow down.

23:11.200 --> 23:12.360
You're totally a lightweight.

23:12.360 --> 23:14.120
If you can't drink,
why did you drink so much?

23:14.120 --> 23:15.710
That's enough, Fei, just drop it.

23:15.710 --> 23:17.880
I can still drink!

23:17.900 --> 23:19.440
-No, you can't.
-Drink!

23:19.710 --> 23:20.600
You can't drink anymore.

23:20.600 --> 23:21.840
Fei, you go in first.

23:22.160 --> 23:22.840
Drink!

23:23.310 --> 23:24.070
Drink.

23:24.200 --> 23:25.440
Alright, alright.

23:25.790 --> 23:27.160
Careful, watch your step.

23:27.160 --> 23:27.840
Come on.

23:29.270 --> 23:29.930
Sit.

23:30.440 --> 23:31.400
Come on.

23:32.990 --> 23:33.730
Hold her steady.

23:33.730 --> 23:35.190
I've got her, I've got her.

23:37.750 --> 23:38.790
Waitress, get me
a cup of hot water please.

23:38.790 --> 23:40.750
You're such a lightweight!

23:40.880 --> 23:41.840
Zero alcohol tolerance.

23:41.840 --> 23:42.640
Sit up. Sit up.

23:42.640 --> 23:44.200
I'm much better than you.

23:44.400 --> 23:45.310
Lying down makes you throw up easily.

23:45.310 --> 23:47.160
You'll feel sick later, Jingjing.

23:47.160 --> 23:48.200
So annoying!

23:48.200 --> 23:49.340
Alright, alright.

24:04.780 --> 24:06.020
You called me before?

24:06.270 --> 24:07.670
What did you need from me?

24:08.840 --> 24:09.790
I was bored.

24:10.070 --> 24:11.600
I pressed the wrong button.

24:15.720 --> 24:17.480
Go find your friends now.

24:17.510 --> 24:20.040
I have serious business
to discuss with Lu Ze.

24:21.360 --> 24:22.440
I haven't even criticized you yet,

24:22.440 --> 24:23.750
and you're already kicking me out, huh?

24:23.750 --> 24:25.600
I'm asking you, why were you
strutting around so late at night,

24:25.600 --> 24:26.680
instead of staying at home?

24:26.680 --> 24:27.740
Strutting around!

24:27.990 --> 24:30.050
What a coincidence, you're here too.

24:30.600 --> 24:32.340
Men and women are different.

24:33.230 --> 24:33.980
In the middle of the night,

24:33.980 --> 24:35.420
and it's just
the two of you girls out there—

24:35.420 --> 24:37.350
do you know how dangerous that was?

24:37.550 --> 24:39.090
And smell yourself, reeking of alcohol.

24:39.090 --> 24:40.550
Is this even appropriate?

24:41.230 --> 24:42.160
Alright, alright.

24:42.160 --> 24:43.510
Slow down or you'll choke.

24:43.510 --> 24:45.550
Are you eating with them or with us?

24:45.550 --> 24:46.780
You have to pick one.

24:46.810 --> 24:48.180
I'm talking to you.

24:49.440 --> 24:50.590
If you hadn't run into me today,

24:50.590 --> 24:51.630
if I hadn't been here,

24:51.630 --> 24:53.920
you'd have been dragged away
by those guys, you know?

24:53.920 --> 24:57.050
The consequences tonight
would've been unimaginable!

25:01.240 --> 25:03.310
I want this papaya snow fungus soup.

25:03.390 --> 25:04.320
What do you want?

25:04.400 --> 25:06.110
Order me a lung-nourishing herbal tea.
I really need to cool down.

25:06.110 --> 25:07.480
-There's no lung-nourishing tea.
-I'm so pissed!

25:07.480 --> 25:09.590
They only have this
century egg and pork congee.

25:09.590 --> 25:10.720
I'm literally mad at you right now.

25:10.720 --> 25:11.480
Can you be a little more serious?

25:11.480 --> 25:13.410
Can you at least give me a reaction?

25:15.040 --> 25:16.200
Go ahead and be mad at me.

25:16.200 --> 25:18.800
Once you're done being mad,
order it yourself.

25:19.150 --> 25:21.680
I'm not mad anymore.
You've worn out my anger.

25:23.310 --> 25:24.480
I have to say, your temper

25:24.480 --> 25:26.740
actually seems a lot better than before.

25:28.000 --> 25:29.060
I'm done ordering.

25:29.350 --> 25:30.760
You guys go ahead and order.

25:30.760 --> 25:32.350
That's the thing about you—

25:32.520 --> 25:35.040
no matter what people say
or how much they yell at you,

25:35.040 --> 25:36.590
you just pretend you didn't hear a thing.

25:36.590 --> 25:37.960
like you didn't even understand.

25:37.960 --> 25:38.920
You just put on that smile

25:38.920 --> 25:41.050
and keep smiling until they calm down.

25:42.480 --> 25:44.390
So I've got that skill, huh?

25:45.610 --> 25:46.850
Ms. Qian, I beg you.

25:46.870 --> 25:48.330
Be more careful now, okay?

25:55.480 --> 25:57.480
Come on, one last push for the Nexus!

25:58.550 --> 25:59.240
Attack the turret!

25:59.240 --> 26:00.040
I'm doing it.

26:00.240 --> 26:01.040
One last push!

26:01.070 --> 26:02.260
Let's end this!

26:02.590 --> 26:03.990
-Let's end this!
-We won!

26:06.630 --> 26:08.630
Not bad. Your skills have improved.

26:16.350 --> 26:17.830
Bad Name!

26:18.460 --> 26:20.000
Bad Name, we won!

26:20.930 --> 26:22.790
You really are the best! Bad Name.

26:44.590 --> 26:45.280
Cheers!

26:47.110 --> 26:47.630
Cheers!

26:47.660 --> 26:49.000
Okay, okay. That's enough.

26:49.000 --> 26:50.110
Enough, enough.

26:53.720 --> 27:00.200
-Ten, nine, eight, seven, six.
-Hurry up. They're doing the countdown!

27:00.230 --> 27:05.140
Five, four, three, two, one.

27:05.350 --> 27:07.480
Happy New Year!

27:17.110 --> 27:18.440
You're still laughing.

27:18.830 --> 27:21.380
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

27:21.600 --> 27:22.740
Don't say sorry to me.

27:22.740 --> 27:23.870
If you could just
behave like a lady for once,

27:23.870 --> 27:25.400
and I'd be beyond grateful.

27:26.830 --> 27:27.760
Happy New Year.

27:28.630 --> 27:29.690
It's a new year now.

27:30.760 --> 27:31.680
Happy New Year.

27:32.630 --> 27:33.550
Make a wish.

27:35.070 --> 27:36.530
If I have to make a wish then,

27:36.530 --> 27:37.720
it must be...

27:39.350 --> 27:41.520
It won't come true if you say it out loud.

27:41.520 --> 27:42.920
Just make it in your head.

28:05.310 --> 28:06.910
Shall we play another round?

28:07.240 --> 28:07.900
Let's do it.

28:08.350 --> 28:08.920
Let's go.

28:12.920 --> 28:14.450
I'll play the ADC this time.

28:14.870 --> 28:15.350
Okay.

28:21.440 --> 28:22.870
You all have to wish me

28:23.120 --> 28:24.320
a thriving career,

28:24.590 --> 28:27.070
a fortune, and a good relationship.

28:27.110 --> 28:27.520
Okay.

28:28.590 --> 28:30.120
Talk about tiny ambitions.

28:30.520 --> 28:33.650
You might as well
just find a guy and get married already.

28:34.310 --> 28:35.000
Well...

28:35.590 --> 28:38.520
The New Year's countdown is over.
You can leave now.

28:39.870 --> 28:42.130
I've got something to discuss with Lu Ze.

28:43.830 --> 28:46.960
You're kicking me out
the second I'm not useful anymore?

28:48.070 --> 28:49.330
Be a good boy. Go ahead.

28:49.330 --> 28:51.190
Are you treating me like a donkey?

28:53.280 --> 28:54.960
But I really should go
explain things to them.

28:54.960 --> 28:56.660
You just wait right here, don't move.

28:56.660 --> 28:58.460
We'll head home together later.

29:06.760 --> 29:08.350
Why isn't Li Yifei here yet?

29:08.730 --> 29:09.970
Where is he?

29:10.440 --> 29:12.920
Where did Li Yifei go? Li Yifei!

29:12.920 --> 29:13.630
He's coming.

29:13.630 --> 29:15.160
No need to move. Don't move.

29:15.390 --> 29:16.760
Speak of the devil. Come on.

29:16.760 --> 29:17.440
Bro!

29:17.480 --> 29:19.300
-Y'all celebrated the New Year without me?
-What are you doing?

29:19.300 --> 29:19.760
Right?

29:19.760 --> 29:20.720
Come on.

29:20.720 --> 29:23.310
-Happy New Year.
-Happy New Year.

29:23.310 --> 29:24.480
-Happy New Year!
-Happy New Year.

29:24.480 --> 29:26.350
Happy New Year, Mr. Li.

29:26.380 --> 29:27.570
Happy New Year.

29:29.480 --> 29:30.950
Have fun, everyone. Eat well, drink well.

29:30.950 --> 29:32.150
We're eating so well.

29:33.370 --> 29:33.830
Feels so good.

29:33.830 --> 29:36.350
This stuff is too strong.
I can't chug this.

29:39.200 --> 29:40.520
What took you so long?

29:40.520 --> 29:42.920
I didn't have an appetite
without you here.

29:44.310 --> 29:45.150
You...

29:45.680 --> 29:47.200
Try the one in front of you.

29:47.200 --> 29:48.180
This one's really delicious.

29:48.180 --> 29:49.680
This dish is so appetizing.

29:49.680 --> 29:50.480
Alright then.

29:50.630 --> 29:51.970
Just this one. Chew it slowly.

29:51.970 --> 29:54.370
Don't talk nonsense while you're chewing.

29:57.390 --> 29:59.080
I'm going to leave in a bit.

29:59.240 --> 30:00.960
Make sure you take good care of them.

30:00.960 --> 30:02.050
Where are you going?

30:02.050 --> 30:04.310
I have to take those two drunk girls home.

30:04.960 --> 30:05.690
Hold on.

30:05.960 --> 30:07.180
You organized this party.

30:07.180 --> 30:08.480
Is it appropriate for you to leave early?

30:08.480 --> 30:09.410
I have no choice.

30:09.790 --> 30:10.550
A tough girl

30:10.550 --> 30:12.550
and her best friend are both wasted.

30:14.550 --> 30:15.790
Which one is the tough girl?

30:15.790 --> 30:17.310
The one with long hair or short hair?

30:17.310 --> 30:18.510
The long-haired one.

30:21.550 --> 30:23.150
What are they talking about?

30:24.000 --> 30:24.960
That tough girl.

30:27.040 --> 30:27.720
Lu Ze.

30:28.790 --> 30:30.550
Why are you here with Jingjing?

30:33.870 --> 30:34.590
I mean,

30:34.720 --> 30:38.410
how did you know
Jingjing and I were there?

30:40.280 --> 30:41.680
I was worried about her.

30:42.040 --> 30:43.830
I couldn't find her
in the middle of the night,

30:43.830 --> 30:45.240
and I heard you singing over the phone,

30:45.240 --> 30:46.520
so I rushed right over.

30:47.110 --> 30:48.840
What are you supposed to do now?

30:52.390 --> 30:53.450
Jingjing must have

30:53.870 --> 30:55.870
told you what's going on between us.

30:56.240 --> 30:58.240
So... what else am I supposed to do?

30:59.350 --> 31:02.440
As Jingjing's best friend,

31:03.240 --> 31:04.040
I think you...

31:04.680 --> 31:06.500
you really hurt her.

31:07.150 --> 31:08.680
If you don't

31:09.390 --> 31:11.050
give us an explanation today,

31:11.760 --> 31:12.790
then Jingjing definitely

31:12.790 --> 31:14.840
won't come back to you.

31:14.860 --> 31:15.620
Got it?

31:16.040 --> 31:18.570
She's made up her mind
to cut you off this time.

31:21.390 --> 31:22.590
Yao Jingjing!

31:23.020 --> 31:23.580
You...

31:23.630 --> 31:27.230
you've got no backbone at all.
You totally went back on your word!

31:29.110 --> 31:30.880
She's just drunk now.

31:31.200 --> 31:32.280
When she sobers up,

31:32.590 --> 31:34.310
who knows how far she'll push me away.

31:34.310 --> 31:35.310
It's good that you know that.

31:35.310 --> 31:36.970
You brought this on yourself.

31:39.680 --> 31:41.070
Jingjing acts like

31:41.520 --> 31:42.590
she's tough and can just walk away,

31:42.590 --> 31:44.790
like she can say harsh words and be fine.

31:45.240 --> 31:47.920
But deep down,
she's more vulnerable than anyone.

31:47.920 --> 31:50.250
She keeps saying she won't wrong herself,

31:51.150 --> 31:52.210
but over the years,

31:52.830 --> 31:54.960
she has sacrificed way too much for me.

31:55.550 --> 31:57.010
I've let her down.

31:58.310 --> 31:59.760
Getting all sentimental like that.

31:59.760 --> 32:01.040
I'll just ask you one thing.

32:01.040 --> 32:01.870
Do you...

32:03.120 --> 32:04.360
still love Jingjing?

32:04.680 --> 32:05.680
Of course I do.

32:08.200 --> 32:09.350
If I didn't love her,

32:09.930 --> 32:12.730
how could I have possibly
shut down Xinxin Vision?

32:13.040 --> 32:14.070
I let so many people down.

32:14.070 --> 32:15.870
But I just don't want to fail her.

32:17.790 --> 32:18.280
Well,

32:18.920 --> 32:19.790
I got it.

32:20.660 --> 32:22.970
Let me ask you one last thing.

32:24.870 --> 32:26.040
What if...

32:27.150 --> 32:28.680
what if you

32:29.520 --> 32:30.390
love Jingjing,

32:30.390 --> 32:33.720
but she doesn't want you back?

32:33.830 --> 32:35.430
What are you going to do then?

32:37.440 --> 32:39.040
I'll keep watching over her.

32:40.550 --> 32:42.810
I'll wait until she's ready to accept me.

32:47.800 --> 32:51.160
Fine, I'll let you pass my test, barely.

32:51.390 --> 32:54.640
Once she wakes up,
I'll talk some sense into her for you.

32:54.680 --> 32:55.630
But,

32:56.720 --> 32:58.530
As for how she's gonna

32:58.720 --> 33:00.480
kick, punch, or bite you when she's awake,

33:00.480 --> 33:01.670
you're on your own.

33:09.680 --> 33:12.210
So the girl I have a crush on
is that tough girl!

33:13.720 --> 33:14.790
Yifei, tell you what.

33:14.790 --> 33:17.050
I'm not gonna beg you for praise anymore.

33:17.870 --> 33:18.630
How about you just

33:18.630 --> 33:20.280
introduce that tough girl to me?

33:20.280 --> 33:20.970
Get lost.

33:21.200 --> 33:22.730
What are you even thinking?

33:24.040 --> 33:24.720
I mean,

33:25.040 --> 33:26.530
what I mean is...

33:26.550 --> 33:27.530
that tough girl,

33:27.680 --> 33:29.110
she looks like a lady on the outside,

33:29.110 --> 33:30.510
but she's much tougher than you.

33:30.510 --> 33:31.230
Got it?

33:32.630 --> 33:36.120
Li Yifei, look at you.

33:36.350 --> 33:38.520
You look like you're afraid
I'll ruin her or something.

33:38.520 --> 33:40.980
You think I don't know
what you're thinking?

33:42.150 --> 33:45.390
You're making it sound like
you're doing it for my own good.

33:45.390 --> 33:47.240
I am doing it for your own good!

33:47.310 --> 33:48.510
Let me tell you,

33:48.590 --> 33:49.870
I'm afraid you're doing this just for fun,

33:49.870 --> 33:51.310
then you won't be able to get rid of her.

33:51.310 --> 33:52.830
She takes life way too seriously—

33:52.830 --> 33:54.160
she's not like us at all.

33:54.400 --> 33:56.060
Either you date her
with the intention of marriage,

33:56.060 --> 33:57.920
or you keep your thoughts to yourself.

33:57.920 --> 34:00.360
You can't handle her,
and you can't afford to get hurt.

34:00.360 --> 34:01.070
If you piss her off,

34:01.070 --> 34:02.980
she'll... she'll cut it off.

34:03.000 --> 34:04.200
She'll cut yours off!

34:05.750 --> 34:06.800
Just eat your skewers.

34:06.800 --> 34:08.070
You've already said it all.

34:08.070 --> 34:09.330
It's for your own good.

34:09.920 --> 34:10.850
Eat some garlic.

34:11.360 --> 34:12.560
Let's drink. Come on.

34:28.400 --> 34:29.040
What?

34:29.320 --> 34:32.120
Why are you all sleeping here?
Are you done eating?

34:33.070 --> 34:34.150
Get up if you're full. Let's go home.

34:34.150 --> 34:35.159
Don't sleep here.

34:35.320 --> 34:35.960
Jingjing?

34:36.840 --> 34:37.440
Jingjing?

34:37.670 --> 34:39.040
Wake up. We're going home.

34:39.040 --> 34:40.000
We're going home.

34:40.000 --> 34:42.929
-Come on. One, two, three.
-Let's go home, Jingjing.

34:47.750 --> 34:49.010
No need to pay the bill.

34:49.960 --> 34:51.040
Already paid?

34:51.190 --> 34:51.960
I told the waiter

34:51.960 --> 34:54.550
to put it on the same tab
as that big private room.

34:54.550 --> 34:56.260
Alright then.
Next time that crowd goes out to eat,

34:56.260 --> 34:58.150
just book a small private room
right next to them for me,

34:58.150 --> 34:58.840
so I can get a free meal.

34:58.840 --> 35:00.740
Then you'll need to keep me entertained,

35:00.740 --> 35:02.670
and good things will come your way.

35:04.150 --> 35:05.110
Sobered up now, have you?

35:05.110 --> 35:06.840
I was never drunk.
That was just the warm-up.

35:06.840 --> 35:09.150
You're not drunk?
You were literally lying here asleep.

35:09.150 --> 35:10.000
You look pretty dizzy to me.

35:10.000 --> 35:10.520
Let me tell you,

35:10.520 --> 35:11.960
if you ever drink yourself into
this kind of state with others again,

35:11.960 --> 35:12.690
I'll just...

35:14.800 --> 35:15.750
Crazy.

35:16.070 --> 35:17.750
Fine, I'll just drink at home from now on.

35:17.750 --> 35:19.480
-Let's go
-Let's go, Jingjing.

35:19.590 --> 35:20.450
We're leaving.

35:21.110 --> 35:22.550
Wait, given the situation today,

35:22.550 --> 35:24.210
I should go back with you guys.

35:25.230 --> 35:26.630
That's not appropriate.

35:27.230 --> 35:28.670
Our situations are different.

35:28.670 --> 35:30.670
I live at her place. She's my landlady.

35:30.670 --> 35:32.270
I can just sleep on the couch.

35:32.320 --> 35:33.480
That's even more inappropriate.

35:33.480 --> 35:34.630
We've signed a contract.

35:34.630 --> 35:36.480
That couch and the living room
belong to me.

35:36.480 --> 35:37.440
No outsiders allowed.

35:37.440 --> 35:38.790
If an outsider comes,
I'll have to pay a fine.

35:38.790 --> 35:41.230
It's mainly because Jingjing
easily throws up when she drinks too much.

35:41.230 --> 35:42.590
If she throws up
in the middle of the night,

35:42.590 --> 35:43.710
it's easier for me to clean up, right?

35:43.710 --> 35:44.920
Then... then you can take the couch.

35:44.920 --> 35:46.100
You can just sleep on the couch.

35:46.100 --> 35:47.430
-Okay.
-Let's go.

35:47.480 --> 35:48.070
Come on.

35:48.190 --> 35:49.550
One, two, three.

35:50.000 --> 35:51.000
Can't believe she drank herself into this.

35:51.000 --> 35:52.130
Come on. Be careful.

35:53.800 --> 35:56.840
-Happy New Year.
-Happy New Year.

35:57.040 --> 35:59.550
-Let's go home.
-Look, I can walk perfectly straight.

35:59.550 --> 36:00.550
Good, good, good.

36:14.570 --> 36:16.380
I feel sick.

36:18.300 --> 36:20.430
I've put a trash can right here for you.

36:49.960 --> 36:51.800
Let... let him come in.

36:52.630 --> 36:54.000
I want to talk to him.

36:59.630 --> 37:01.830
Have you figured out what to talk about?

37:05.270 --> 37:07.000
Okay, have a good talk then.

37:07.080 --> 37:08.940
Tell me when you're done talking.

37:32.550 --> 37:33.950
What are you laughing at?

37:34.670 --> 37:35.630
Nothing.

37:36.550 --> 37:38.350
I just think you're so pathetic.

37:39.320 --> 37:40.320
You're like

37:41.190 --> 37:43.230
the Little Match Girl, you know?

37:44.110 --> 37:45.510
It's literally New Year,

37:46.680 --> 37:49.210
and your entire nest
just got occupied by someone else.

37:49.210 --> 37:51.540
You're being dramatic again, aren't you?

37:52.520 --> 37:54.740
Alright, Happy New Year.

37:54.770 --> 37:55.480
Good night.

37:56.000 --> 37:56.660
Good night.

37:56.800 --> 37:58.200
I'm going to sleep in bed.

38:01.360 --> 38:03.710
Sleeping in my cozy little bed.

38:03.740 --> 38:05.600
Sleeping in my little nest.

38:08.920 --> 38:10.770
They're fighting!

38:10.920 --> 38:11.400
No, no, no.

38:11.400 --> 38:13.110
Don't open the door.

38:18.480 --> 38:19.600
Sorry. Sorry.

38:19.620 --> 38:21.170
You go on.

38:23.000 --> 38:24.590
Are you a peeping Tom?

38:25.080 --> 38:26.280
I told you not to go in.

38:26.480 --> 38:27.610
Come on. Have a seat.

38:33.280 --> 38:35.150
See how accurate my words are?

38:35.970 --> 38:37.190
I said your bed would get taken over,

38:37.190 --> 38:38.260
and it actually did.

38:38.260 --> 38:39.750
And it's taken over by two people!

38:39.750 --> 38:40.590
Wait a minute.

38:42.190 --> 38:43.320
Tonight,

38:43.350 --> 38:46.720
Jingjing cried to me for so long.

38:47.440 --> 38:48.590
And yet just a few hours later,

38:48.590 --> 38:50.040
how did these two end up...

38:50.040 --> 38:51.270
Do you know why?

38:54.800 --> 38:56.250
Because you're silly.

38:56.320 --> 38:57.360
You're the silly one!

38:57.360 --> 38:58.590
I'm going to sleep.

38:59.660 --> 39:01.570
Take care of yourself. Don't catch a cold.

39:01.570 --> 39:03.830
Good night. Don't catch a cold.

39:04.040 --> 39:04.880
Good night.

39:17.000 --> 39:20.000
Are you performing an opera
in the middle of the night?

39:20.630 --> 39:22.410
So comfortable.

39:24.670 --> 39:25.590
So dramatic.

39:25.630 --> 39:27.440
What kind of bed is this?

40:18.150 --> 40:18.920
Morning.

40:20.670 --> 40:21.890
Come over and sit.

40:22.550 --> 40:25.880
A combination of East and West.
Perfect. Come over quickly.

40:40.190 --> 40:41.190
Not bad.

40:44.880 --> 40:46.480
Quick, eat it while it's hot.

40:49.210 --> 40:50.320
Thanks.

41:00.880 --> 41:01.440
Jingjing.

41:01.440 --> 41:02.190
Don't ask me.

41:02.550 --> 41:03.670
I blacked out last night.

41:03.670 --> 41:05.400
I don't remember anything now.

41:05.520 --> 41:06.490
Blacked out?

41:06.590 --> 41:08.580
-Blacked out or pretending to black out?
-She blaced out.

41:08.580 --> 41:09.320
For real.

41:09.810 --> 41:11.930
Judging by your guilty look,

41:12.310 --> 41:13.960
it doesn't seem like you blacked out.

41:13.960 --> 41:15.960
I have to play along with you, right?

41:17.800 --> 41:19.070
Look at the two of you right now,

41:19.070 --> 41:20.730
sitting there all righteous,

41:20.750 --> 41:21.940
acting as if

41:21.960 --> 41:23.620
nothing happened last night.

41:32.440 --> 41:34.100
What's wrong with your mouth?

41:34.440 --> 41:36.040
What's wrong with her mouth?

41:36.040 --> 41:37.040
Where? Let me see.

41:40.190 --> 41:41.150
It seems swollen.

41:41.150 --> 41:41.950
You're right.

41:43.630 --> 41:46.110
I spent the whole night yelling at him.

41:46.230 --> 41:47.950
I wore my lips out.

41:48.480 --> 41:49.630
I'm exhausted.

41:54.040 --> 41:55.040
Yao Jingjing.

41:55.750 --> 41:56.810
Look at your lips!

41:56.880 --> 41:59.740
Your lips are swollen
from kissing, like sausages!

41:59.840 --> 42:01.410
If you two

42:01.480 --> 42:03.440
ever fight again and come to me

42:03.440 --> 42:04.320
to drink in the middle of the night,

42:04.320 --> 42:07.110
we'll see if I'm still willing
to keep you company.

42:07.110 --> 42:08.310
You'll still have to.

42:08.350 --> 42:10.350
It's all your fault, troublemaker.

42:15.070 --> 42:17.020
I'm full. I'm heading out first.

42:17.920 --> 42:20.200
Guys, a new year, a new beginning.

42:21.960 --> 42:23.160
By the way, landlady.

42:23.460 --> 42:25.210
If you are cooking today,

42:25.230 --> 42:26.910
save me a little of every dish.
I'll heat them up later.

42:26.910 --> 42:27.460
Okay.

42:28.000 --> 42:30.750
Also, there's a shirt in my room.

42:30.780 --> 42:32.360
I hung it up. Can you iron it for me?

42:32.360 --> 42:33.560
It's my favorite one.

42:34.880 --> 42:35.590
Also,

42:35.810 --> 42:37.470
that trash can in my bathroom

42:37.490 --> 42:38.820
needs to be cleared out.

42:39.000 --> 42:40.920
You really love
playing the boss, don't you?

42:40.920 --> 42:42.550
I'll fill it up in a bit!

42:48.000 --> 42:50.060
Here, have some porridge to sober up.

42:52.200 --> 42:53.670
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.100 --> 42:55.360
There are six months left

42:55.360 --> 42:56.320
until your exam.

42:56.350 --> 42:58.540
I've already make a customized study plan

42:58.540 --> 43:00.870
based on your current level and progress.

43:01.400 --> 43:02.990
You've taken care of everything for me?

43:02.990 --> 43:04.770
Hurry up and boil the tea eggs,

43:05.590 --> 43:07.400
then come listen to my lecture.

43:07.430 --> 43:08.140
Yes, sir!

43:11.880 --> 43:12.590
Hello, Dad.

43:13.020 --> 43:14.570
Remember that senior leader

43:14.570 --> 43:15.890
who once arranged a job for me?

43:15.890 --> 43:17.420
His son is also in Shanghai.

43:17.850 --> 43:19.910
He's going to add you on WeChat later.

43:20.150 --> 43:21.110
Remember to accept his request!
